{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25195","headline":"农家望晴 · 雍裕之","name":"农家望晴","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"尝闻秦地西风雨，爲问西风早晚回。\n白发老农如鹤立，麦场高处望云开。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"雍裕之","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25195.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25195","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言绝句","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry、据《唐诗鉴赏辞典》（周啸天主编，商务印书馆国际有限公司，2012年1月版）「农家望晴」条，撰者周啸天、《全唐诗》（清·曹寅等编，康熙扬州诗局本）","citation":"周啸天"}